[0.953332, "o", "  question: \u001b[36m\"why did production go down last night?\"\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(Ctrl+C any time → final report)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L0 · THE WIRE — where your words physically go \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.053454, "o", "│  you press Enter → POST /v1/chat/completions, HTTP/2, TLS 1.3.\r\n"]
[1.053575, "o", "│  ~1.2 KB in TCP segments → NIC → fiber → load balancer → scheduler queue.\r\n"]
[1.12859, "o", "│  \u001b[32m✔ ~38 ms. the question is inside a datacenter.\u001b[0m \u001b[31mnobody armed the 'decides it's done' part.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.128746, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L1 · TOKENIZER — text stops being text \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
