[1.128955, "o", "│  ids   : \u001b[33m[3808, 62627, 19605, 13604, 101318, 17690, 6828, 63]\u001b[0m\r\n│  8 tokens in. every token out costs real compute.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L2 · GPU — the machine your question now lives in \u001b[2m─────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  H100 · 80 GB HBM3 · ~700 W · 3.35 TB/s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.229125, "o", "│  weights: \u001b[35m8B × 2 bytes\u001b[0m = 14.9 GiB resident, \u001b[2mloaded once at boot. never reload.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.229271, "o", "│  KV cache pool: \u001b[33m24.4 GiB\u001b[0m \u001b[2m(128 KiB/token × 200k)\u001b[0m — the context window IS spare VRAM.\r\n│  \u001b[32m✔ model resident. KV zeroed. ready.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L3 · ONE DECODE STEP — what 'thinking' is physically \u001b[2m──────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m│  ×32 layers per token\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.329379, "o", "│    q,k,v = h·W_qkv → attn = softmax(q·kᵀ/√d)·v ← reads EVERY past k,v\r\n"]
[1.329501, "o", "│    MLP → logits = h·W_unembed [4096→128256] → softmax(T=0.7) → 1 token → repeat\r\n│  \u001b[33m≈16 GFLOP/token + an attention tax that grows with context.\u001b[0m \u001b[2mthere is only this loop.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m┌─ L4 · DECODE LOOP — prefill done. now it generates… forever \u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n│  sampling: temp=0.7 · \u001b[31mrep_penalty=1.0 (OFF)\u001b[0m · \u001b[31mmax_tokens=null\u001b[0m · stop_strings=[]\r\n\u001b[2m│  decode begins. watch what never fires.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
